# So! What exactly is an African dance co-op?

[![Student Day March (9)](/media/2013/09/Student-Day-March-9.jpg)](/so-what-exactly-is-a-dance-co-op/student-day-march-9/)

We will be running a dance Co-op from 7.30-8.30pm on Tuesday evenings starting Ocober 15th. Drummers are welcome to stay after drumming class to drum for the dancers.  This co-op will be a gold coin donation and it is a space where lovers of African Dance can come together and share some dance moves with live drumming.  The sessions will be informally lead by Bec and Shaye.  Absolute beginners and experienced dancers are encouraged to join us to help create an African dancing vibe here on the Sunshine Coast! Families welcome :)

For more information and bookings ph 0434585992 or email: [info@rhythmculture.com.au](mailto:info@rhythmculture.com.au)
